flowchart LR
  W[Wakefulness] --> N1[NREM 1<br/>~10 min<br/>Transition]
  N1 --> N2[NREM 2<br/>10–25 min<br/>50% of sleep]
  N2 --> N3[NREM 3<br/>Onset Deep Sleep]
  N3 --> N4[NREM 4<br/>Deep Sleep<br/>No eye/muscle activity]
  N4 --> R[REM<br/>70–90 min in<br/>Dreams · Brain wave ≈ awake]
  R -.cycle repeats with more REM each time.-> N2
